+"""Exp 5212: GAP-4 expanded-pool scale validation.
+
+Spec refs: REQ-REPORT-5212, SCENARIO-REPORT-5212,
+SCENARIO-REPORT-5212-BLOCKED-PROTOCOL-METADATA.
+
